<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
    <main class="w-full">
      <div id="content" class="container opacity-0"><section data-section-type="text_and_single_image" data-section-id="pg061_sec001" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 py-8 max-sm:px-5 bg-white text-slate-800"><div class="w-full mb-8"><div class="bg-purple-500"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-8 max-sm:px-5 py-4"><h1 class="adt-h2 font-bold text-white" data-id="pg061_n0002">Vendi ku jetoj</h1></div></div></div><div class="mb-6"><h3 class="adt-h3 font-semibold text-slate-800 border-b-4 border-purple-400 pb-3 inline-block min-w-[32rem] max-lg:min-w-0" data-id="pg061_n0004">Pavar&#xeb;sia e Kosov&#xeb;s</h3></div><div class="mb-5"><h3 class="adt-h3 inline-block bg-green-500 text-slate-900 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-sm" data-id="pg061_n0007">Situata 1.</h3></div><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed mb-4 text-left"><span data-id="pg061_n0009">N&#xeb; familjen e Kledit po p&#xeb;rgatiten p&#xeb;r udh&#xeb;tim.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0010">Ata do t&#xeb; shkojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r pushime n&#xeb; Angli.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0011">Sa i emocionuar &#xeb;sht&#xeb; Kledi 6-vje&#xe7;ar, sepse &#xeb;sht&#xeb; hera e par&#xeb; q&#xeb; ai do t&#xeb; udh&#xeb;toj&#xeb; me aeroplan.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0012">T&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; po mblidhnin gj&#xeb;rat e nevojshme dhe po i palosnin n&#xeb; valixhe.</span></p><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed mb-4 text-left"><span data-id="pg061_n0014">Mamaja erdhi me pasaportat n&#xeb; dor&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0015">K&#xeb;to jan&#xeb; m&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishmet, se pa to nuk mund t&#xeb; hyjm&#xeb; n&#xeb; aeroplan.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0016">Kledi mori pasaport&#xeb;n n&#xeb; dor&#xeb; dhe po e shikonte me kujdes.</span></p><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed mb-4 text-left"><span data-id="pg061_n0018">- Babi, - pyeti ai.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0019">- Pse n&#xeb; pasaport&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; flamuri yn&#xeb;?</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0020">- Nuk &#xeb;sht&#xeb; flamuri, biri im.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0021">&#xcb;sht&#xeb; stema e Kosov&#xeb;s, - tha babai.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0022">- &#xc7;far&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; stema?</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0023">- Secili shtet ka flamurin, stem&#xeb;n dhe himnin e tij.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0024">K&#xeb;to jan&#xeb; simbolet e shtetit.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0025">Simbolet e p&#xeb;rfaq&#xeb;sojn&#xeb; shtetin ton&#xeb; n&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; bot&#xeb;n.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0026">Edhe shteti yn&#xeb;, Kosova jon&#xeb; e dashur, q&#xeb; nga data 17 shkurt 2008, ka fituar Pavar&#xeb;sin&#xeb;, &#xeb;sht&#xeb; shpallur shtet dhe quhet Republika e Kosov&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0027">17 Shkurti &#xeb;sht&#xeb; festa jon&#xeb; shtet&#xeb;rore.</span></p><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed mb-4 text-left"><span data-id="pg061_n0029">- Pse n&#xeb; flamur jan&#xeb; gjasht&#xeb; yje? - vazhdoi Kledi.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0030">- Sepse, p&#xeb;rve&#xe7; shqiptar&#xeb;ve, n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; edhe popuj t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0031">- Ua, - nd&#xeb;rhyri mamaja.</span> <span data-id="pg061_n0032">- Vazhdoni nj&#xeb; her&#xeb; tjet&#xeb;r bised&#xeb;n se koha po ik&#xeb;n e ne duhet t&#xeb; nisemi.</span></p><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed mb-6 text-left"><span data-id="pg061_n0034">Kledi p&#xeb;r her&#xeb; t&#xeb; par&#xeb; d&#xeb;gjoi p&#xeb;r simbolet e shtetit dhe iu duk shum&#xeb; interesante.</span></p><div class="mt-8"><img src="images/pg061_im001_seg003_v1.png" alt="Babai dhe djali po p&#xeb;rgatisin valixhen p&#xeb;r udh&#xeb;tim; djali mban pasaport&#xeb;n, nd&#xeb;rsa sip&#xeb;r shihen flamuri dhe stema e Kosov&#xeb;s." data-id="pg061_im001_seg003_v1" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg"></div></section></div>
